name: Selected compiler input drives real source-only clangd and survives source drift
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS KUZUSHI_MCP_CLANG_BIN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: options uaf-hunt:hunt
require-live-snap: 20 uaf-hunt:hunt | compiler-options
keys: Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Key: externalCompileCommandsPath | external-compiler-option
ask: Is the separate out-of-tree compiler-file option understandable, with bounded private copying and no implied Scan completion?
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 5
expect: Protected review calls: 1
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 40 UAF source analysis: 0 candidates | completed-source-analysis
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | result-120x36
expect: Compiler commands: 1
expect: cost unavailable
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
expect: 0 candidates
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Result | result-40x12
expect: 0 candidates
expect: Outcome · completed
expect: cost unavailable
expect: Workspace 0 findings
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 FROZEN COMPILER CONFIGURATION | inputs-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Source SHA-256 | inputs-120x36
expect: Commands: 1
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inputs-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inputs-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inputs-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inputs-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: inputs-restored-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | inputs-end-40x12
keys: PPage
require-live-snap: 20 receipt omits | inputs-omissions-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 model prompt | inputs-tail-40x12
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Receipt | receipt-40x12
keys: Tab
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 0 candidates | result-restored-40x12
ask: Do the result and compiler receipt distinguish completed local navigation, zero unverified candidates, unknown cost and captured compiler identity at all six sizes, including omitted commands and model prompt?
resize: 120x36
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART headless @TMP_HOME
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 4/5 | shared-headless-budget
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | headless-result
expect: Compiler commands: 1
expect: calls 4/5 at read
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 4 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 4/5 | recovered-budget
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/clang_database.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | recovered-result
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 0 candidates | no-color-result-40x12
keys: Tab
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 FROZEN COMPILER CONFIGURATION | no-color-inputs-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | no-color-inputs-end-40x12
keys: PPage
require-live-snap: 20 receipt omits | no-color-inputs-omissions-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 model prompt | no-color-inputs-tail-40x12
ask: Does no-color restart retain the original compiler receipt and protected Review accounting despite the original database changing, without new requests or accepted findings?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
